      "message": "This assertion fails under `drivers.flash.page_layout` and `drivers.flash.page_layout.ec_host_cmd` (`CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USE_ZEPHYR_FLASH_PAGE_LAYOUT\u003dy`).\n\nWhen `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USE_ZEPHYR_FLASH_PAGE_LAYOUT` is enabled, `CONFIG_FLASH_MULTIPLE_REGION` is defined (`zephyr/shim/include/config_chip.h:764`), so `crec_flash_erase()` skips `flash_range_ok()` and calls `cros_flash_emul_erase()`. In `zephyr/emul/emul_flash.c:109`, `if (flash_check_writable_range(offset, size))` converts the `EC_ERROR_INVAL` from `offset + size \u003e CONFIG_FLASH_SIZE_BYTES` into `EC_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED` (4).\n\nConsider either checking `IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USE_ZEPHYR_FLASH_PAGE_LAYOUT) ? EC_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED : EC_ERROR_INVAL` here, or propagating the return value of `flash_check_writable_range()` in `cros_flash_emul_erase()`.",
